WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,880
Yeah, then I'll leave first

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,500
lick the dog lick the dog

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,220
Licking until there is nothing left

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:20,420
It’s time to go see Lulin. Sorry.

5
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,620
Too tired today

6
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:22,740
accidentally fell asleep

7
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,170
You can also put pressure on your wound.

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,180
you are still here

9
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,860
I want to pay for you first

10
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,190
But the amount is too high and I don’t have any money either

11
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:35,430
This girl looks like her family conditions are average

12
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:36,870
Tens of thousands of dollars for her

13
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,030
It's really not a small amount

14
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:41,340
Lend me your cell phone

15
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:45,460
Hello it's me

16
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,860
I'm fine. My leg is broken.

17
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,660
This is the Central Hospital. Please do me a favor and press your watch to locate it.

18
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,260
Go to Qingming Mountain and get the three backpacks back

19
00:00:51,660 --> 00:01:06,900
Would you like some water?
